WEBVTT

00:00:00.419 --> 00:00:05.471
Before pipeline review, see which deals need action, and who owns them.

00:00:05.471 --> 00:00:10.247
Open deals sit in three sections, biggest deals first.

00:00:10.247 --> 00:00:11.960
Start with Escalated.

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:16.542
Each deal shows its owner, how late it is, and the next step on record.

00:00:16.542 --> 00:00:19.899
On the timeline, red runs a late deal to today,

00:00:19.899 --> 00:00:23.742
and a diamond marks each close-date change.

00:00:23.844 --> 00:00:27.629
To find one deal, search by deal or account name.

00:00:27.629 --> 00:00:31.409
Open a deal in Salesforce, where its owner updates it.

00:00:31.722 --> 00:00:35.539
Walk in knowing which deals to raise, and with whom.

00:00:35.539 --> 00:00:40.202
Become a design partner at revenue.opsgs.com.
